<br/>
<br/>As you can see, theres a lot of stuff to buy with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=341/emblem-of-frost">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_frostemblem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Frost</span></span></a>. We want to focus our emblems on what will eventually be BIS. Sigil and Tier should be your main focus.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Blood Death Knights in Phase 4</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="head">Head options for Blood Death Knight Tanks in Phase 4</h3>You have 2 helms available here that are equal in terms of EHP. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51306/sanctified-scourgelord-faceguard">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_151.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Scourgelord Faceguard</span></a> offers slightly more avoidance and more damage, where as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50640/broken-ram-skull-helm">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_151.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Broken Ram Skull Helm</span></a> offers a lot of Hit. Both options are great, you can't go wrong with either.<div class="pad"></div>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=67839/mind-amplification-dish">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mind Amplification Dish</span></a> is easily our best, it requires Engineering (but everyone should be Engineering anyways). With the abundance of Defense on gear and the use of <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=62158/rune-of-the-stoneskin-gargoyle">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_130.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rune of the Stoneskin Gargoyle</span></a>, we won't need the Defense from <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50369/arcanum-of-the-stalwart-protector">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_swordandboard.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of the Stalwart Protector</span></a> but it is a solid second choice.<div class="pad"></div>
