<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="wrist">Wrist options for Blood Death Knight Tanks in Phase 4</h3>Wrists are a little more interesting, along with switching up our professions from <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=51311/jewelcrafting">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Jewelcrafting</span></a> to <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=51302/leatherworking">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leatherworking</span></a> - we get two great bracer options to play around with! <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51901/gargoyle-spit-bracers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_43.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gargoyle Spit Bracers</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50611/bracers-of-dark-reckoning">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_43.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of Dark Reckoning</span></a> are both very good options, with the ladder coming slightly above in terms of TMI. You can't go wrong with either, but for bosses with scary melee attacks, Armor is king. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Bracer Enchant</b>: We're changing up enchants in this slot. Due to Epic gems coming out, the value of <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=51311/jewelcrafting">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Jewelcrafting</span></a> has gone down. The Stamina gain you can get from <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=51311/jewelcrafting">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Jewelcrafting</span></a> is now only 63 compared to its previous 91, and seeing as we don't need the trinket anymore - we're picking up <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=51302/leatherworking">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leatherworking</span></a> to get <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=57690/fur-lining-stamina">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fur Lining - Stamina</span></a>. While This does result in a 1 Stamina loss, this allows us to pick-up <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=57694/fur-lining-frost-resist">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fur Lining - Frost Resist</span></a> for <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=36853/sindragosa">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sindragosa</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
