<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="hands">Hand options for Blood Death Knight Tanks in Phase 4</h3>Seeing similar things here like we did bracers and chest. These high armor pieces reign supreme. Also, tier slot - the alternatives in this slot aren't better than the alternatives in other slots.<br/>
