<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Expertise</span></a> if you feel like you need it - but you'll be missing a lot of extra armor.<div class="pad"></div>
