<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="legs">Leg options for Blood Death Knight Tanks in Phase 4</h3>Legs are another tier slot where we could see some item swapping depending on your luck for other tier slot alternatives. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51308/sanctified-scourgelord-legguards">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_31.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Scourgelord Legguards</span></a> share similar Stamina and Armor values as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51131/sanctified-scourgelord-legguards">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_31.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Scourgelord Legguards</span></a>. The tier has slightly more Dodge which won't be very noticeable, but the tier has an allocation of 93 Expertise, versus the others 85 Hit. Allowing you to gear for what you feel you need more, and what you could possibly swap around else where. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Leg Armor:</b> Since we're now <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=51302/leatherworking">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leatherworking</span></a>, you could use <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=60583/jormungar-leg-reinforcements">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Jormungar Leg Reinforcements</span></a> which is cheaper to put on versus our original leg enchant we've been with for a while now, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=38373/frosthide-leg-armor">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_32.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Frosthide Leg Armor</span></a>. They're the same thing, so whichever you want to do.<div class="pad"></div>
