<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="feet">Feet options for Blood Death Knight Tanks in Phase 4</h3>With the addition of  <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=39863/halion">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Halion</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54579/treads-of-impending-resurrection">
