<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="rings">Ring options for Blood Death Knight Tanks in Phase 4</h3>Ice Crown gives a plethora of ring options, a lot of them very good. There's a lot of flexibility in what you wear depending on drops, but there will always be one constant that should not change and that's [tem=50404]. The armor proc on this is great, and the ring has fantastic stats. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50622/deviums-eternally-cold-ring">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_86.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Devium's Eternally Cold Ring</span></a> provides a substantial amount of armor making it an amazing 2nd option, but whether you can use it or not depends on if it drops for you.<br/>
